{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in an RNA-only, singleprofile setting, achieving validation accuracy of 0.520 and F1 of 0.498, outperforming the previous pca_n2000 baseline (0.485 accuracy, 0.464 F1). The result suggests RNA encoder selection may influence performance, though other factors could contribute to the difference. The impact of encoder choice remains uncertain without further controlled comparisons."
}

